  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With a noun",
     "texto": [
      "**Nonostante** and **malgrado** go with a noun: **nonostante la pioggia** (in spite of the rain), **malgrado tutto** (in spite of everything)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Linking connectors",
     "texto": [
      "**Invece** expresses contrast: **Io esco, tu invece resti?** (I'm going out; are you staying instead?). **Eppure** introduces something surprising: **È stanco, eppure lavora** (he's tired, yet he works)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
